// 终端舞台 —— 终端页（page 1，会话中）的内容：分屏 / 标签条 / 每标签一份 TerminalView
// / 分屏拖拽条。
//
// 旧外壳删除②-2：从主窗口文件（当时叫 `ui/app.slint`，第③步搬成
// `ui/shell/app_shell.slint`）的 `pane-area` + `for pane` + `for sp` 原样搬来。
//
// 数据流（与搬家前逐字一致）：
//   * `panes` / `terminals` / `splitters` 都是 AppWindow 的窗口级模型；
//   * 每个 pane 里给**所有**标签各实例化一份 TerminalView，只把 `pane.active-id` 那份
//     visible 并撑满 —— 切标签因此不重建组件（滚动、悬停、查找条、快捷命令面板等
//     per-tab UI 状态都留着）。Slint 不允许 `if` 直接嵌在 `for` 里，所以用
//     visible + 0 尺寸切换，而不是条件实例化。
//   * 组件看不到窗口的属性 / 回调，所以窗口级设置在这里声明成**同名**属性、会话内的
//     对话框状态声明成同名 in-out，实例化处 1:1 转发 —— 搬过来的正文因此保持
//     `root.xxx` 原样。
//
// 没搬进来的旧外壳遗留：快捷命令侧栏的拖拽停靠（`quick-dock-drag-move` / `-end`）——
// 快捷侧栏 2026-09 已按需求移除、`quick-panel-docked` 恒为 false，那两条回调在舞台上
// 直接不接（Slint 回调允许不绑定），顺带不再牵扯 dock-area / welcome-sidebar 那套旧几何。
//
// 终端页重做①（2026-09-28）：TerminalView 内部的旧外壳（底部命令栏 / 24px 状态条 /
// 内嵌 SFTP 停靠区）整体删除，舞台不再向它转发那批属性与回调 —— 现在每个 TerminalView
// 就是一块纯画布（画面 / 输入 / 选区 / 查找），页面的会话条、工具面板、状态栏都在舞台上。

import { Theme } from "../theme.slint";
import { AnimationSettings } from "../theme.slint";
import { PaneInfo, SplitterInfo, TerminalState } from "stage_types.slint";
import { PaneTabs } from "pane_tabs.slint";
import { HistoryPanel } from "history_panel.slint";
import { TerminalView, QuickCmd } from "../terminal_view.slint";
import { TabInfo } from "../tabs.slint";

export component TerminalStage inherits Rectangle {
    // --- 数据模型（AppWindow 级）-------------------------------------------
    in property <[PaneInfo]> panes;
    in property <[TerminalState]> terminals;
    in property <[SplitterInfo]> splitters;
    in property <[TabInfo]> tabs;                 // SFTP 跨标签传输目标
    in property <string> active-tab-id;
    in property <bool> lang-en: false;
    // 顶栏两个开关的当前状态（按钮常亮用）
    in property <bool> right-panel-open: false;
    // 快捷指令下拉的展开状态（列表画在本组件里，见 pane 循环之后 —— 只有声明在
    // 终端画面之后才不会被画面盖住）
    property <bool> quick-open: false;
    // 历史命令浮层的展开状态（终端页重做③）：双向 —— 状态栏「历史命令」按钮、
    // ⌘⇧R 快捷键与浮层自己的关闭按钮都改它（窗口侧同名属性透传给状态栏）。
    in-out property <bool> history-open: false;

    // --- 终端外观 / 会话态（AppWindow 的设置项）---------------------------
    in property <int> terminal-focus-sequence: 0;
    in property <string> term-cursor-style: "block";
    in property <color> term-cursor-color;
    in property <bool> terminal-restore-cover: false;
    // 命令历史：底部命令栏删除后，只由「历史命令」浮层消费（见本文件尾部）。
    in property <[string]> command-history;
    in property <[string]> history-view;
    in property <[string]> history-preview;
    in property <[QuickCmd]> quick-commands;

    // --- 会话内共享状态 / 对话框状态（舞台上就地改，所以双向）-------------
    in-out property <bool> sftp-prompt-open: false;
    in-out property <string> sftp-prompt-kind;    // "rename"|"chmod"|"mkdir"|"touch"
    in-out property <string> sftp-prompt-tab;
    in-out property <string> sftp-prompt-target;
    in-out property <string> sftp-prompt-value;
    in-out property <bool> confirm-delete-open: false;
    in-out property <bool> confirm-delete-batch: false;
    in-out property <string> confirm-delete-tab;
    in-out property <string> confirm-delete-path;
    in-out property <bool> quick-cmd-manage-open: false;
    in-out property <string> qcm-name;
    in-out property <string> qcm-command;
    in-out property <string> qcm-group;
    in-out property <int> qcm-edit-index: -1;
    in-out property <bool> qcg-open: false;
    in-out property <string> qcg-name;
    in-out property <string> qcg-orig;

    // --- 回调（窗口级；标签 id 由舞台从 `term.id` / `pane` 补上）-----------
    callback content-resized(length, length);
    // 分屏 / 标签条
    callback pane-tab-selected(int, string);
    callback pane-tab-closed(int, string);
    callback tab-rename-request(string);
    callback pane-new-tab(int);
    callback pane-split(int, string, int);
    callback toggle-zen-key();
    callback toggle-right-panel();
    callback toggle-history();      // 画布里的 ⌘⇧R / Ctrl+Shift+R → 开/关历史浮层
    callback cycle-tab(bool);
    callback splitter-drag(int, length, bool);
    // 终端输入 / 尺寸 / 滚动
    callback send-key(string, string, bool, bool, bool);
    callback terminal-resize(string, int, int);
    callback terminal-mouse(string, int, int, int, int) -> bool;
    callback terminal-wheel(string, int, int, int);
    callback terminal-scroll(string, int);
    callback terminal-scroll-to(string, int);
    callback terminal-scrollback-key(string, string) -> bool;
    callback term-select-start(string, int, int, bool, bool, bool);
    callback term-select-update(string, int, int, bool);
    callback term-select-end(string);
    callback term-select-word(string, int, int);
    callback term-select-line(string, int, int);
    callback term-select-autoscroll(string, int);
    callback paste-from-clipboard(string);
    callback copy-terminal-text(string);
    callback clear-terminal(string);
    callback find-query-changed(string, string);
    callback find-next(string);
    callback find-prev(string);
    // 命令栏 / 快捷命令 / 历史
    callback run-command(string, string, bool);
    callback copy-text(string);
    callback delete-history(int);
    callback delete-history-cmd(string);
    callback search-history(string);
    callback toggle-quick-group(string);
    callback edit-quick-command(int);
    callback duplicate-quick-command(int);
    callback delete-quick-command(int);
    callback move-quick-command(int, string);
    callback delete-quick-group(string);
    // SFTP（终端内嵌面板的旧链路；新外壳的文件面板走窗口级 active-sftp-*）
    callback sftp-navigate(string, string);
    callback sftp-download(string, string);
    callback sftp-upload-clicked(string, string, bool);
    callback sftp-refresh(string, string);
    callback sftp-tree-expand(string, string);
    callback sftp-toggle-select(string, int);
    callback sftp-download-selected(string);
    callback sftp-copy-to-target(string, string, string);
    callback sftp-copy-selected-to-target(string, string);
    callback sftp-view(string, string);
    callback sftp-edit(string, string);
    callback sftp-open-external(string, string);
    callback sftp-edit-external(string, string);
    callback sftp-sort-request(string, string);
    callback sftp-clear-sort(string);
    callback sftp-copy-path(string);
    callback sftp-chmod-open(string, string, string, int);
    callback set-pane-sftp-height(string, length);
    callback set-pane-sftp-width(string, length);
    callback set-pane-sftp-collapsed(string, bool);
    // 隧道
    callback tunnel-add(string, string, string, string, string, string, string);
    callback tunnel-stop(string, string);

    // 报告舞台尺寸给 Rust —— 它按这个尺寸把分屏树 flatten 成 `panes`（原 pane-area 的职责）。
    changed width => { root.content-resized(self.width, self.height); }
    changed height => { root.content-resized(self.width, self.height); }

    for pane[pi] in root.panes : Rectangle {
        x: pane.x; y: pane.y; width: pane.w; height: pane.h;
        clip: true;

        VerticalLayout {
            spacing: 0;

            HorizontalLayout {
                spacing: 0;

                // 标签条（A-2.4，按参考图）：药丸标签 + ➕ + 快捷指令/分屏/全屏。
                // 旧 TabBar 的拖拽排序 / 跨分屏合并 / 重复标签暂未迁移。
                PaneTabs {
                    pane-id: pane.id;
                    tabs: pane.tabs;
                    active-id: pane.active-id;
                    reserve-right: pane.reserve-right;
                    quick-count: root.quick-commands.length;
                    panel-open: root.right-panel-open;
                    quick-open: root.quick-open;
                    lang-en: root.lang-en;
                    tab-selected(id) => { root.pane-tab-selected(pane.id, id); }
                    tab-closed(id) => { root.pane-tab-closed(pane.id, id); }
                    tab-rename-requested(id) => { root.tab-rename-request(id); }
                    new-tab() => { root.pane-new-tab(pane.id); }
                    split-active() => { root.pane-split(pane.id, pane.active-id, 0); }
                    toggle-panel() => { root.toggle-right-panel(); }
                    toggle-quick() => { root.quick-open = !root.quick-open; }
                    toggle-full() => { root.toggle-zen-key(); }
                }
            }

            // Content area swaps based on active tab kind.
            Rectangle {
                vertical-stretch: 1;
                background: Theme.sur-0;

                // 空 pane（分屏后还没放标签）：给一条提示，别留一片空洞。
                if pane.tabs.length == 0 : Rectangle {
                    width: parent.width;
                    height: parent.height;

                    Text {
                        text: root.lang-en
                            ? "Pick a host on the left to begin"
                            : "从左侧「主机」里选一个会话开始";
                        color: Theme.fg-3;
                        font-size: 11px;
                        horizontal-alignment: center;
                        vertical-alignment: center;
                    }
                }

                // Terminal tabs — one TerminalView per terminal state. Only
                // the one matching `active-tab-id` is visible. Slint doesn't
                // allow nesting `if` directly inside a `for`, so we toggle
                // visibility instead and rely on the layout to overlap them.
                for term[i] in root.terminals : TerminalView {
                    visible: term.id == pane.active-id;
                    active: term.id == root.active-tab-id;
                    focus-sequence: root.terminal-focus-sequence;
                    width: term.id == pane.active-id ? parent.width : 0px;
                    height: term.id == pane.active-id ? parent.height : 0px;
                    tab-id: term.id;
                    spans: term.spans;
                    cursor-row: term.cursor-row;
                    cursor-col: term.cursor-col;
                    cursor-style: root.term-cursor-style;
                    cursor-color: root.term-cursor-color;
                    rows-used: term.rows-used;
                    scroll-max: term.scroll-max;
                    scroll-offset: term.scroll-offset;
                    is-alt-screen: term.is-alt-screen;
                    mouse-tracked: term.mouse-tracked;
                    terminal-mouse(kind, button, col, row) => {
                        root.terminal-mouse(term.id, kind, button, col, row);
                    }
                    find-matches: term.find-matches;
                    selection: term.selection;
                    send-key(key, ctrl, alt, shift) => { root.send-key(term.id, key, ctrl, alt, shift) }
                    cycle-tab(reverse) => { root.cycle-tab(reverse); }
                    toggle-history() => { root.history-open = !root.history-open; }
                    terminal-resize(w, h) => { root.terminal-resize(term.id, w, h) }
                    paste-from-clipboard() => { root.paste-from-clipboard(term.id); }
                    copy-terminal-text() => { root.copy-terminal-text(term.id); }
                    clear-terminal() => { root.clear-terminal(term.id); }
                    find-query-changed(q) => { root.find-query-changed(term.id, q); }
                    find-next() => { root.find-next(term.id); }
                    find-prev() => { root.find-prev(term.id); }
                    terminal-scroll(d) => { root.terminal-scroll(term.id, d); }
                    terminal-wheel(d, c, r) => { root.terminal-wheel(term.id, d, c, r); }
                    terminal-scroll-to(o) => { root.terminal-scroll-to(term.id, o); }
                    terminal-scrollback-key(key) => { root.terminal-scrollback-key(term.id, key) }
                    select-start(r, c, lh, ctrl, shift) => { root.term-select-start(term.id, r, c, lh, ctrl, shift); }
                    select-word(r, c) => { root.term-select-word(term.id, r, c); }
                    select-line(r, c) => { root.term-select-line(term.id, r, c); }
                    select-update(r, c, lh) => { root.term-select-update(term.id, r, c, lh); }
                    select-end() => { root.term-select-end(term.id); }
                    select-autoscroll(dir) => { root.term-select-autoscroll(term.id, dir); }
                }

                // Windows may show the terminal model being reconstructed when
                // restoring from minimize (#183). Briefly cover the terminal area
                // until the restore repaint settles; the underlying PTY/buffer is
                // untouched.
                if root.terminal-restore-cover && pane.active-id != "welcome" && pane.tabs.length > 0 : Rectangle {
                    width: parent.width;
                    height: parent.height;
                    background: Theme.term-bg;
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // ── 快捷指令下拉（参考图顶栏「快捷指令 ▾」）─────────────────────────
    // 声明在 pane 循环之后 = 画在终端画面之上（PaneTabs 自己溢出的话会被画面盖住）；
    // 点空白处收起。列表直接来自 `quick-commands` 模型（真数据），点一条即走
    // `run-command`（`send-enter` 由 Rust 侧决定是否补一个回车）。
    for pane[qi] in root.panes : Rectangle {
        visible: pane.focused && root.quick-open;
        x: pane.x; y: pane.y; width: pane.w; height: pane.h;
        background: transparent;
        clip: true;

        back-ta := TouchArea {
            clicked => {
                root.quick-open = false;
            }
        }

        Rectangle {
            x: max(8px, parent.width - 300px);
            y: 42px;                                   // 标签条（40px）正下方
            width: min(300px, parent.width - 16px);
            height: min(card-l.preferred-height, 260px);
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: Theme.line;
            background: Theme.sur-1;
            clip: true;

            card-l := VerticalLayout {
                padding: 6px;
                spacing: 2px;
                alignment: start;

                if root.quick-commands.length == 0 : Text {
                    text: root.lang-en
                        ? "No snippets yet — add them on the Snippets page"
                        : "还没有快捷指令 —— 到「指令集」页添加";
                    font-size: 11px;
                    color: Theme.fg-3;
                    wrap: word-wrap;
                }

                for q in root.quick-commands : Rectangle {
                    height: 32px;
                    border-radius: 5px;
                    background: q-ta.has-hover ? Theme.sur-3 : transparent;

                    HorizontalLayout {
                        padding-left: 8px;
                        padding-right: 8px;
                        spacing: 8px;

                        VerticalLayout {
                            horizontal-stretch: 1;
                            alignment: center;
                            spacing: 0px;

                            Text {
                                text: q.name;
                                font-size: 11px;
                                color: Theme.fg-1;
                                overflow: elide;
                            }
                            Text {
                                text: q.command-preview;
                                font-size: 9px;
                                color: Theme.fg-3;
                                overflow: elide;
                            }
                        }
                    }
                    q-ta := TouchArea {
                        mouse-cursor: pointer;
                        clicked => {
                            root.run-command(pane.active-id, q.command, false);
                            root.quick-open = false;
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // Draggable splitters between panes. Single pane => the model is
    // empty, so this renders nothing. The handle is a thin 6px bar but its
    // TouchArea reaches ±5px beyond so it's easy to grab.
    for sp[si] in root.splitters : Rectangle {
        x: sp.x; y: sp.y; width: sp.w; height: sp.h;
        background: sp-ta.has-hover || sp-ta.pressed ? Theme.accent : Theme.line;
        animate background {
            duration: 100ms;
            easing: AnimationSettings.color();
            enabled: AnimationSettings.enabled;
        }
        sp-ta := TouchArea {
            x: sp.vertical ? -5px : 0px;
            y: sp.vertical ? 0px : -5px;
            width: sp.vertical ? parent.width + 10px : parent.width;
            height: sp.vertical ? parent.height : parent.height + 10px;
            mouse-cursor: sp.vertical ? ew-resize : ns-resize;
            moved => {
                if (self.pressed) {
                    root.splitter-drag(sp.split-id,
                        sp.vertical ? sp.x - 5px + self.mouse-x
                                    : sp.y - 5px + self.mouse-y,
                        sp.vertical);
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // 历史命令浮层（终端页重做③）：声明在最后 = 画在最上层；点击浮层以外关闭。
    // 数据来自窗口级 command-history / history-view / history-preview（Rust 填充），
    // 运行 / 删除走既有的 run-command / delete-history-cmd 链路。
    if root.history-open : Rectangle {
        x: 0;
        y: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;

        backdrop := TouchArea {
            clicked => {
                root.history-open = false;
            }
        }

        HistoryPanel {
            x: Theme.sp-3;
            y: max(Theme.sp-2, root.height - self.height - Theme.sp-3);
            width: 360px;
            height: min(400px, root.height - Theme.sp-4);
            lang-en: root.lang-en;
            open: root.history-open;
            entries: root.history-view;
            previews: root.history-preview;
            run(cmd) => {
                root.run-command(root.active-tab-id, cmd, false);
                root.history-open = false;
            }
            remove(cmd) => { root.delete-history-cmd(cmd); }
            search(q) => { root.search-history(q); }
            closed() => { root.history-open = false; }
        }
    }
}
